.TH MCBLOCKFACE 6 "22 October 2026" "Blocky McBlockface" "Games"

.SH NAME
mcblockface \- Blocky McBlockface dedicated server

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mcblockface
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
[\fIWORLD PATH\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION
Blocky McBlockface is a voxel game server based on MultiCraft 2.0.6 and Minetest.
It supports Minetest 0.4 and 5.x clients and Lua mods.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print allowed options and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version and build information and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-config " path"
Load configuration from the specified file.
.TP
.BI \-\-logfile " path"
Write logs to the specified file. An empty value disables file logging.
.TP
.B \-\-info
Print more information to the console.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Print additional information to the console.
.TP
.B \-\-trace
Print trace-level information to the console.
.TP
.B \-\-quiet
Print only errors to the console.
.TP
.BI \-\-color " value"
Set colored logging to
.BR always ,
.BR never ,
or
.BR auto .
.TP
.BI \-\-gameid " value"
Select a game. Use
.B \-\-gameid list
to list available games.
.TP
.BI \-\-world " path"
Use the world at the specified path.
.TP
.BI \-\-worldname " name"
Use a world by name.
.TP
.BI \-\-worldlist " mode"
List worlds and exit. The mode is
.BR path ,
.BR name ,
or
.BR both .
.TP
.BI \-\-map\-dir " path"
Deprecated alias for
.BR \-\-world .
.TP
.BI \-\-port " value"
Set the UDP server port.
.TP
.BI \-\-migrate " backend"
Migrate the selected world's map database to another backend.
.TP
.BI \-\-migrate\-auth " backend"
Migrate the selected world's authentication database to another backend.
.TP
.BI \-\-migrate\-players " backend"
Migrate the selected world's player database to another backend.
.TP
.B \-\-terminal
Run with an interactive ncurses console when terminal support is compiled in.
.TP
.B \-\-run\-unittests
Run the unit tests and exit.

.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.mcblockface/
Default user-data directory for an installed Unix build.
.TP
.B mcblockface.conf
Read from the user-data directory or its parent. Run-in-place builds also
search the grandparent directory. If it is absent,
.B minetest.conf
is tried in the same locations. Use
.B \-\-config
to select an explicit file.

.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MINETEST_SUBGAME_PATH
Colon-delimited list of directories to search for games.

.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/monk-afk/blocky-mcblockface/issues.

.SH AUTHOR
Luanti development team and contributors.

.SH WWW
https://github.com/monk-afk/blocky-mcblockface
